From 9e1c6c2f311f3df2688db7445a5cb1d77ac03a14 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 19:30:19 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] tor: updated to 0.4.9.12

The Tor Project's 2026-09-08 security release. Reaper's Tor configuration sets
AutomapHostsOnResolve, the precondition of the use-after-free it fixes
(TROVE-2026-036); the release also carries the OOM-handling, consensus-diff,
CC_RESPONSE and DNS-name fixes (TROVE-2026-032..043). Pristine 0.4.9.11 ->
0.4.9.12 diff; both tarball hashes verified against dist.torproject.org.
Security review 2026-09-12, item R03.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
